  "prefLabel": "Plc 2104.02 Scheduling the Neutral Evaluation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2104.02 Scheduling the Neutral Evaluation. Following the selection of a neutral evaluator, the parties shall:\n\n(a) Schedule the neutral evaluation to occur within 30 days of the date the neutral evaluator was selected;\n\n(b) Agree to the time, date, and place of the neutral evaluation; and\n\n(c) Specify the date by which the parties shall furnish the neutral evaluator with the information and documentation required by Plc 2104.03(a).\n\nSource. #14331, eff 8-20-25, EXPIRES: 8-20-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2100.html"
